      titleTr: 'Girdi Açıklamaları',
      content: `Cutting Speed (Vc):
• Definition: Surface speed of tool or workpiece (m/min)
• Symbol: Vc or v
• Range: Material and tool dependent
• Example: Steel with carbide: 100-300 m/min

Spindle Speed (n):
• Definition: Rotational speed (RPM or rev/min)
• Symbol: n or N
• Relationship: n = (Vc × 1000) / (π × D)
• D = diameter in mm

Feed Rate (f):
• Definition: Distance per revolution (mm/rev)
• Symbol: f or feed per rev
• Related: f = feed/tooth × number of teeth

Feed per Tooth (fz):
• Definition: Feed per cutting edge (mm/tooth)
• Symbol: fz
• Relationship: f = fz × number of teeth

Axial Depth (ap):
• Definition: Cutting depth perpendicular to feed (mm)
• Symbol: ap or axial depth
• Machine limit: Maximum Z-axis depth capacity

Radial Depth (ae):
• Definition: Cutting depth in feed direction (mm)
• Symbol: ae or radial depth
• Machine limit: Tool overhang and rigidity`,
