      content: 'Assumptions in Honing Module:\n\nMachine Assumptions:\n• Equipment is maintained and calibrated\n• Spindle speed range includes required speeds\n• Feed rate capability matches requirements\n• Work envelope accommodates part geometry\n• Coolant system is functional (if required)\n\nMaterial Assumptions:\n• Material grade is correctly specified\n• Material properties are as published\n• No hidden defects or variations\n• Batch-to-batch variation is acceptable\n• Thermal properties are constant\n\nTool Assumptions:\n• Cutting tool geometry is as specified\n• Tool life correlates with standard references\n• Tool holder interface is precise\n• Coating is properly applied\n• Tool materials are legitimate\n\nProcess Assumptions:\n• Operator follows documented procedures\n• Setup is accurate and repeatable\n• No external vibration or disturbance\n• Environment is stable\n• All prerequisite steps are completed\n\nData Assumptions:\n• Input parameters are accurate\n• No misinterpretation of specifications\n• All constraints are identified\n• No missing critical information\n\nCRITICAL:\nIf any assumption cannot be verified, document this limitation.\nDo NOT proceed as if all assumptions are certain.\nUse Validation module to test key assumptions.',
