      content: 'Decision Criteria for Machines:\n\nThis module provides decision FRAMEWORK, not decision AUTHORITY.\n\nFeasibility Assessment (Not Production Approval):\nProcess is Potentially Feasible if:\n✓ All required parameters are available\n✓ Machine constraints are within capability\n✓ Tool options exist for this process\n✓ Material properties are understood\n✓ Assumptions are documented\n\nProcess May Need Reconsideration if:\n⚠ Critical parameters are missing or unknown\n⚠ Machine capability is marginal for geometry\n⚠ No suitable tools exist in current inventory\n⚠ Material behavior under process is unverified\n⚠ Assumptions cannot be validated\n\nProcess NOT Feasible if:\n✗ Machine lacks geometric or speed capability\n✗ No cutting tool options exist\n✗ Workpiece material is incompatible\n✗ All critical uncertainties cannot be resolved\n\nIMPORTANT:\nNO production decision can be made from this analysis alone.\nALL findings must be validated through testing.\nEngineering team review is MANDATORY.\nValidation module engagement is REQUIRED before production.',
